	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"2006年に放映された『仮面ライダーカブト』が新規パーツを追加し装いも新たにFigure-rise Standardにラインナップ！",
			"• 胸部のアーマー、肩のアーマーを新規で造形。胸部の可動範囲の拡大と、実際のスーツに近い肩部の色分けを再現。",
			"• 股関節などの可動範囲の向上により、ライダーキックやクロックアップなどのポージングの再現が可能に。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Kamen Rider Kabuto\", which was aired in 2006, has added new parts and a new look to the Figure-rise Standard lineup!",
			"• Newly sculpted chest armor and shoulder armor. The range of motion of the chest has been expanded, and the color coding of the shoulders has been recreated to be similar to the actual suit.",
			"• Improved range of motion in the hip joints, etc. makes it possible to reproduce poses such as rider kick and clock up."
		]
	},
